<title>ITALY: U.S. military plane missing off Israel coast-navy.</title>
<headline>U.S. military plane missing off Israel coast-navy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Viking S-3B plane from the aircraft carrier USS Roosevelt with four crew on board went missing off the coast of Israel on Tuesday night, the U.S Sixth Fleet said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The jet aircraft, usually used for anti-submarine warfare, was on a routine training mission when it disappeared from radar at 1756 GMT Tuesday night 87 miles off the coast of Haifa.</p>
<p>Aircraft from the carrier were conducting a search and rescue operation, the Sixth Fleet said.</p>
</text>
